    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/f5a7c2d2a396fb8999c199dae8eb85ec.poster.avif?t=1751398846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/f5a7c2d2a396fb8999c199dae8eb85ec.webm?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/f5a7c2d2a396fb8999c199dae8eb85ec.mp4?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Welcome to World of Stickman, an exciting real-time strategy world where you'll take part in epic battles of antiquity with Stickman heroes. Choose your civilization - Romans, Egyptians or Vikings - and go to war to rule the ancient world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/023a025ff62b5576c77764b1f491ba0a.poster.avif?t=1751398846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/023a025ff62b5576c77764b1f491ba0a.webm?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/023a025ff62b5576c77764b1f491ba0a.mp4?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Game Features</strong>:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Epic Battles</strong>: Experience the scale of great battles in real time with hundreds of fighting stickmen. Control various types of troops such as swordsmen, pikemen, archers, ballistae and catapults to defeat the enemy.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/2ef1355b5e8435a2ab60f29d98e4f660.poster.avif?t=1751398846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/2ef1355b5e8435a2ab60f29d98e4f660.webm?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/2ef1355b5e8435a2ab60f29d98e4f660.mp4?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Building and Development</strong>: Your domain starts with a small settlement. Develop, build buildings, gather resources and strengthen your army. Upgrade buildings to gain access to new units and technologies.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/79faedbaf445a89cdea4c40e21c4dd7d.poster.avif?t=1751398846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/79faedbaf445a89cdea4c40e21c4dd7d.webm?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/79faedbaf445a89cdea4c40e21c4dd7d.mp4?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Campaign</strong>: Immerse yourself in an exciting campaign that reveals the stories and legends of each civilization. Meet unique characters, traverse key historical moments, and defeat enemies.<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer and Online</strong>: Challenge your friends to battle in multiplayer mode or immerse yourself in online battles with players from around the world. Show off your strategic prowess and top the leaderboards.<br></li><li><strong>Unique Civilizations</strong>: Choose your side among a trio of powerful civilizations - Romans, Egyptians and Vikings. Each has unique features, units and strategic advantages.<br></li><li><strong>Cartoon Style</strong>: Immerse yourself in a colorful world brought to life with a unique cartoon style and 3D graphics. Watch stickmen battle it out in a fabulous world.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/7038d645ad25bbe91dcc9419201a28c8.poster.avif?t=1751398846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/7038d645ad25bbe91dcc9419201a28c8.webm?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/7038d645ad25bbe91dcc9419201a28c8.mp4?t=1751398846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take up the challenge and become a great leader in the classic World of Stickman military strategy game. Your strategy will decide the fate of the ancient world!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922500/extras/385eb5659be31f60576a04cfe9fe40d1.avif?t=1751398846\" /></div>",
